## ⚙️ How the Dashboard Works

The dashboard works by converting raw Adventure Works sales data into an interactive and easy-to-understand visual report.

### 🔄 Data Analysis Workflow

```text
Raw Sales Data
      ↓
Data Cleaning & Preparation
      ↓
Pivot Tables / Calculations
      ↓
KPIs & Measures
      ↓
Charts & Visualizations
      ↓
Interactive Slicers & Filters
      ↓
Business Insights
